# Your free ngrok static domain, e.g. nimble-otter-42.ngrok-free.app
#
# Claim it once at https://dashboard.ngrok.com -> Domains. It never changes,
# which is the entire point: the three Trello registrations that depend on it
# (connector URL, icon URL, and the allowed origin under Authorization ->
# Trello Auth) are then set once and never touched again.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. .env.local is gitignored.
NGROK_DOMAIN=
